# Git push

One GitHub repo: `https://github.com/khutayant/hlu.git`

| Local folder | Branch |
|--------------|--------|
| `hlu/` | `ui` |
| `hlu-server/` | `server` |
| `hlu-work/` | `hlu-work` |
| `tickets/` | `ticket` |
| `discussions/` | `discussion` |
| `docs/` | `docs` |

## Commands

- **`git push`** (no branch named): run  
  `bash /Users/aungminoo/Projects/HLU/scripts/git-push-all.sh`  
  Pushes **all** branches above.
- **`git push hlu-work`**: from `hlu-work/`, run `npm run git:push`
- **`git push ticket`**: from `tickets/`, run `npm run git:push`
- **`git push discussion`**: from `discussions/`, run `npm run git:push`
- **`git push docs`**: from `docs/`, run `npm run git:push`

## Agent execution

- Commit pending changes before pushing.
- Shell `required_permissions: ["all"]`.
- If Auto-review blocks, retry with `request_smart_mode_approval: true` and the given block reason.

## Auth

- PAT: `hlu-work/scripts/.github-pat`, `hlu-work/.github-pat`, `/Users/aungminoo/Projects/HLU/.github-pat`, or `GITHUB_TOKEN` / `GH_TOKEN`.
- Never put the token in chat, logs, or the remote URL.

## After push — always show these tables (exact labels)

**Messages**

| Branch | Message |
|--------|---------|
| ui / server / hlu-work / ticket / discussion / docs | latest commit subject |

**Results**

| Branch | Result |
|--------|--------|
| ui / server / hlu-work / ticket / discussion / docs | `<short-hash> pushed ok` or `<short-hash> push failed` |
